  "title": "Trail Mix Bars",
  "description": "Two kinds of cereal, sunflower seeds, raisins, and chocolate chips are sweetened with honey and peanut butter and cut into bars in this easy no-bake recipe. Grab a bar for breakfast on the go or a quick and easy snack.",
